---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="More Advantages">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid opacity-30"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="mb-4 inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm">Why Choose Us</div>
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-extrabold md:text-6xl">More Advantages</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/70">Additional benefits of choosing SBDMC for your business</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relative bg-gray-50 py-24">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid-dark"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 text-white shadow-lg">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Strategic Location</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Close to major shipping routes, airports, and expressways. Easy access to Manila and neighboring provinces.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-500 to-accent-600 text-white shadow-lg">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Skilled Workforce</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Access to a large pool of skilled and educated workers from Central Luzon.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 text-white shadow-lg">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">World-Class Facilities</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Modern infrastructure including power, water, telecom, and security systems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-500 to-accent-600 text-white shadow-lg">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Business Support</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Comprehensive business services including registration assistance and permits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 text-white shadow-lg">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Quality of Life</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Excellent living conditions with recreational facilities, beaches, and a safe environment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="mb-5 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-500 to-accent-600 text-white shadow-lg">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Global Connectivity</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Excellent international connectivity through Subic Bay International Airport and seaport.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
